Brazilian forestry engineer, botanist and scientist interested in taxonomy, systematics, and evolution. I'm a PhD candidate at the Instituto Nacional de Pesquisas da Amazônia (INPA). My research focuses on Taxonomy and Systematics of Neotropical Chrysophylloideae (Sapotaceae), with a fellowship funded by the Conselho Nacional de Desenvolvimento Científico e Tecnológico ([CNPq](http://www.cnpq.br), process no. 142214/ 2018-3). I’m also highly curious about new methods and technology and willing to learn from and share knowledge with others. (she/her/hers) 

